{"id":"605c16dc24fa234a","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-concept-network-complete.md","title":"Concept Network Complete","display":"df-concept-network-complete — Concept Network Complete","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-concept-network-complete","aliases":["92-df-concept-network-complete"],"display":"df-concept-network-complete — Concept Network Complete","depends_on":["[[92-df-final-count]]"],"source":"本地标签与依赖闭合约定","source_status":"本地元数据"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-concept-network-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-concept-network-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-concept-network-complete — Concept Network Complete"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d115b577d99026dc\" href=\"?note=d115b577d99026dc\" title=\"92-df-final-count\">92-df-final-count</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地标签与依赖闭合约定"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地元数据"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}\">\\(\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}\\)</span> (atom-document set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d115b577d99026dc\" href=\"?note=d115b577d99026dc\" title=\"92-df-final-count\">92-df-final-count</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Label}\">\\(\\mathrm{Label}\\)</span> (document-label universe)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda:\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}\\to\\mathrm{Label}\">\\(\\lambda:\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}\\to\\mathrm{Label}\\)</span> (frontmatter-label map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dep}:\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Label})\">\\(\\operatorname{Dep}:\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Label})\\)</span> (direct-dependency map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{External}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Label}\">\\(\\mathrm{External}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Label}\\)</span> (allowed external labels)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteNet}_{92}\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteNet}_{92}\\)</span> (definition-target dependency-closure predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}concept\\text{-}network\\text{-}complete} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompleteNet}_{92}\\leftrightarrow\n\\lambda:\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Label}\\land\n\\mathrm{External}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Label}\\setminus\\lambda[\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}]\\land\n\\forall a\\in\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Dep}(a)\\subseteq\\lambda[\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}]\\cup\\mathrm{External}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}concept\\text{-}network\\text{-}complete} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompleteNet}_{92}\\leftrightarrow\n\\lambda:\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Label}\\land\n\\mathrm{External}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Label}\\setminus\\lambda[\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}]\\land\n\\forall a\\in\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Dep}(a)\\subseteq\\lambda[\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}]\\cup\\mathrm{External}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>概念网络完成</li>\n<li>“完成”仅指本节点定义的引用闭合属性；主题覆盖需另论证</li>\n<li>每个内部 label 唯一标识一个原子，且每条直接依赖解析为内部 label 或显式允许的外部 label</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteNet}_{92}\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteNet}_{92}\\)</span> 只表达引用闭合与标签唯一性，不声称主题覆盖完备或每个数学断言均已证明</li>\n<li>从基础到高级</li>\n<li>形式系统到不完备性</li>\n<li>算术化到自引用</li>\n<li>递归论到模型论</li>\n<li>是否满足该谓词由实际标签与依赖清单核对，不能从名称推出</li>\n<li>可进一步扩展细节</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>此谓词仅检查标签单射与直接引用解析，不检查图无环、主题覆盖、公式签名或定理证明。扫描结果与语义复核范围须另看报告。</p>\n<p>原书定位：本地标签与依赖闭合约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-final-count","status":"resolved","id":"d115b577d99026dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-final-count]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-final-count","status":"resolved","id":"d115b577d99026dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}$ (atom-document set, see [[92-df-final-count]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Label}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda:\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}\\to\\mathrm{Label}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Dep}:\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Label})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{External}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Label}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompleteNet}_{92}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}concept\\text{-}network\\text{-}complete} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompleteNet}_{92}\\leftrightarrow\n\\lambda:\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Label}\\land\n\\mathrm{External}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Label}\\setminus\\lambda[\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}]\\land\n\\forall a\\in\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Dep}(a)\\subseteq\\lambda[\\mathrm{Atoms}_{92}]\\cup\\mathrm{External}\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompleteNet}_{92}","display":false}],"bytes":2087,"backlinks":[{"id":"d115b577d99026dc","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"依赖闭合性由 [[92-df-concept-network-complete]] 的独立谓词刻画"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-concept-network-complete]]"}]